    "answer": {
      "short": "3 years",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}I&=Prn\\\\1687.50&=7500\\times0.075\\times n\\\\n&=\\frac{1687.50}{7500\\times0.075}\\\\n&=3\\end{align*}$$\nThe money has been borrowed for 3 years.",
